{
 "scenario": "A CAEX file describing assembly cell AC-1 of a fictional plant builder, exchanged between its plant engineering and control engineering tools: an instance hierarchy of a work cell holding a welding robot with a vacuum gripper, a belt conveyor and a PLC, their ports and signal interfaces, the internal links between them, and attributes with units, semantics and nominal constraints. Behind the instances stand a system unit class library with the robot and gripper types — the gripper's supported role class mapped to a user-defined role class by attribute name — and user-defined role and interface class libraries, alongside external references to AutomationML's standard libraries.",
